# scripts/opcount: `collectbench bench reslicegap N` is the reslice
# workload with a statement between the empty let and the collect
# (GP-RESLICE-EMPTY). The control copies the part into a slice made to
# size, as reslice's does.
unit element
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench reslicegap {n}
control benchmarks/collect/testdata/control
